      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Capability-gate notes: which checks never ran, and why (unknown date, unknown language).\n2. Ladder outcome: not_planned (never looked) versus exhausted (looked, found nothing).\n3. Keyword rung skipped: headline was all stopwords, so the broadest query was never built.\nRead this before reading any count. A low count from a narrow search is not a finding about the article.",
      "originalText": "1. Capability-gate notes: which checks never ran, and why (unknown date, unknown language).\n2. Ladder outcome: not_planned (never looked) versus exhausted (looked, found nothing).\n3. Keyword rung skipped: headline was all stopwords, so the broadest query was never built.\nRead this before reading any count. A low count from a narrow search is not a finding about the article.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
